# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Revisions listed here are skipped by `git blame` so large, mechanical commits
# (e.g. repo-wide reformatting) don't obscure the real authorship of each line.
#
# Activate locally (once per clone):
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub's web blame honors this file automatically — no setup needed.
#
# Each entry must be the FULL 40-character commit SHA, one per line.

